        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Lego-Kanto-Region-Badges-Collection-on-a-desk.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Yesterday, Lego fully unveiled its official Pok&eacute;mon sets, which include the rather chonky Venusaur, Charizard and Blastoise model. This chap was notable not only for its size and price tag (it is retailing for &pound;579.99), but the fact that if you pre-ordered it, you would also get your hands on the Lego Pok&eacute;mon Kanto Region Badge Collection as a gift with purchase while stocks lasted.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/if-you-really-want-those-pokemon-lego-kanto-region-badges-you-can-expect-to-pay-over-100-on-ebay-thanks-to-scalpers\">Read more</a></p>",
