        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Arc-Raiders-pickaxe.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>No matter how you feel about <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/arc-raiders-review\">Arc Raiders</a>' use of AI for NPC voices, it's hard to deny the game has been a massive success that's \"cracked open\" the extraction shooter subgenre for casual players and <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/new-games-performed-really-well-on-steam-last-year-shaking-the-dominance-of-the-same-old-live-service-games\">even harpooned some older live service whales</a>. Now, it's hit a new milestone which positions it as one of the new online shooters to watch out for.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/arc-raiders-has-now-sold-more-than-12-million-copies-so-youre-all-getting-a-golden-pickaxe-as-a-reward\">Read more</a></p>",
